0%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.79" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.79" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261006/202610062159412967.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261006/202610062159412967.jpg"> </div><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-06/6ac50603f29a4native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">邵佳一：很抱歉没给球迷增添快乐 比赛输了但过程教练组可以接受</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-06/6ac50ab44845enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">邵佳一：培养年轻球员有点苦涩但会坚持 我18岁时没有他们的能力</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260924/6ab527b1b24d2_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260924/6ab527b1b24d2.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260924/6ab527b1b24d2.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">重庆邀请赛，国足0-1不敌塔吉克斯坦遭遇三连败，国足主帅邵佳一赛后出席发布会。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-06/6ac508c443bebnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">47场首红！韦世豪吃到国足生涯首张红牌，国青、国奥曾两度染红</a></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">据统计，这是韦世豪代表中国男足成年国家队47场比赛，首次吃到红牌。在国字号青年队比赛中，韦世豪还有过两次红牌经历。</span></p><p><strong><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">【梅西迎国家队告别赛】</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-07/6ac50e0c1beb7native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">梅西先发出战告别赛！阿根廷vs贝宁：恩佐、小蜘蛛、劳塔罗首发</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261005/202610051735574977_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261005/202610051735574977_1280.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261005/202610051735574977_1280.jpg"> </div><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-06/6ac504e12a65fnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">难讲再见！梅西告别战前自白:感谢大家爱我如此之深 你们永存我心</a></p><p></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-07/6ac5281158c81native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">身份+1！梅西领取布宜诺斯艾利斯大学荣誉博士学位证书</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261007/202610070056167204_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%